'''Express Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] and can be unlocked when beating [[Realm of Carnage (Deadly)|Realm of Carnage]]. [[True Form]] was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] which increases health, attack power and movement speed. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]], this unit was added [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] but was later obtainable in the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.7 Update|December 15, 2023 Update Patch]].

