==Trivia==
*Bullet Train Cat is the second fastest Unit in the game, being slower than [[Sonic (Uber Rare Cat)|Sonic]] and [[Shadow (Uber Rare Cat)|Shadow]].
**Prior to [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]], Bullet Train Cat was the fastest Unit in the game, with the next fastest cat being [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Stone Cat]] having 1 less speed.
*Maglev Cat levitates off the ground: this is due to it being based on [[wikipedia:Maglev|Maglev]] (Magnetic Levitation) trains.
*Each of Express Cat's forms are based on a different series of [[wikipedia:Shinkansen|Shinkansen]] passenger trains.
**The Normal Form is based off the [[wikipedia:0 Series Shinkansen|0 Series]] trains, Maglev Cat closely resembling the [[wikipedia:SCMaglev|MLU-002]] trains and Bullet Train Cat resembling the LINEA trains.
*The excessive 2s in Express Cat's descriptions reference the fact that 2 is pronounced ''ni'' in Japanese, which sounds similar to ''nyan'', the Japanese word for a cat's meow.

